  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to implementation of the Developing Countries Trading Scheme (DCTS) in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Bangladesh to increase exports to the UK under Developing Countries Trading Scheme (DCTS) in particular supporting diversification of exports in priority sectors which are not big recipients users  of UK&#x2019;s unilateral trade preferences. Specifically, review of existing literature and trade programmes in Bangladesh and identification of priority areas for reform, capacity building and technical assistance that would capacitate these priority sectors to take advantage of the DCTS and increase their exports to the UK.</narrative>
  </description>
